{"layout_dets": [{"category_type": "text_block", "poly": [249.9336, 311.087, 1353.9723000000001, 311.087, 1353.9723000000001, 395.0571, 249.9336, 395.0571], "ignore": false, "order": 2, "anno_id": "box_id_0", "attribute": {}, "text": "The new elements are written $ {a}_{rc}^{\\left( 2\\right) } $ to indicate that this is the second time that a number has been stored in the matrix at location$(r,c)$. The result after step 2 is"}, {"category_type": "equation_isolated", "poly": [510.90763328324806, 414.8188673828124, 1090.8025512695312, 414.8188673828124, 1090.8025512695312, 759.7412109375, 510.90763328324806, 759.7412109375], "ignore": false, "order": 3, "anno_id": "box_id_1", "attribute": {}, "latex": "$$\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}a_{11}^{(1)} & a_{12}^{(1)} & a_{13}^{(1)}\\cdots & a_{1N}^{(1)} & a_{1,N+1}^{(1)}\\\\ 0 & a_{22}^{(2)} & a_{23}^{(2)}\\cdots & a_{2N}^{(2)} & a_{2,N+1}^{(2)}\\\\ 0 & a_{32}^{(2)} & a_{33}^{(2)}\\cdots & a_{3N}^{(2)} & a_{3,N+1}^{(2)}\\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots\\\\ 0 & a_{N2}^{(2)} & a_{N3}^{(2)}\\cdots & a_{NN}^{(2)} & a_{N,N+1}^{(2)}\\end{array}\\right].$$"}, {"category_type": "text_block", "poly": [247.95, 769.0631999999999, 1353.9723000000001, 769.0631999999999, 1353.9723000000001, 886.0132000000001, 247.95, 886.0132000000001], "ignore": false, "order": 4, "anno_id": "box_id_2", "attribute": {}, "text": "*Step 3.* If necessary, switch the second row with some row below it so that $ {a}_{22}^{\\left( 2\\right) } \\neq 0 $ ; then eliminate $ {x}_{2} $ in rows 3 through $N $. In this process,$ {m}_{r2} $ is the multiple of row 2 that is subtracted from row$  r $ ."}, {"category_type": "code_txt", "poly": [573.9242567382812, 904.0235000000001, 978.9624633789061, 904.0235000000001, 978.9624633789061, 1205.9766845703125, 573.9242567382812, 1205.9766845703125], "ignore": false, "order": 5, "anno_id": "box_id_3", "attribute": {}, "text": "\u2018\u2019for r = 3 : N\n\nm_r2 = $a_{r2}^{(2)} / a_{22}^{(2)}$;\n\n$a_{r2}^{(3)} $= 0;\n\nfor c = 3 : N + 1\n\n$a_{rc}^{(3)} = a_{rc}^{(2)}      $$ m_r2 * a_{2c}^{(2)}$,\n\nend\n\nend\u2018\u2019"}, {"category_type": "text_block", "poly": [248.94180000000003, 1227.0394, 1354.9641, 1227.0394, 1354.9641, 1311.9451, 248.94180000000003, 1311.9451], "ignore": false, "order": 6, "anno_id": "box_id_4", "attribute": {}, "text": "The new elements are written ${a}_{rc}^{\\left( 3\\right) } $ to indicate that this is the third time that a number has been stored in the matrix at location$(r,c)$. The result after step 3 is"}, {"category_type": "equation_isolated", "poly": [512.857641919582, 1329.0198, 1102.0551, 1329.0198, 1102.0551, 1674.0223, 512.857641919582, 1674.0223], "ignore": false, "order": 7, "anno_id": "box_id_5", "attribute": {}, "latex": "$$\\left[\\begin{array}{ccccc|c}a_{11}^{(1)} & a_{12}^{(1)} & a_{13}^{(1)} & \\cdots & a_{1N}^{(1)} & a_{1,N+1}^{(1)}\\\\ 0 & a_{22}^{(2)} & a_{23}^{(2)} & \\cdots & a_{2N}^{(2)} & a_{2,N+1}^{(2)}\\\\ 0 & 0 & a_{33}^{(3)} & \\cdots & a_{3N}^{(3)} & a_{3,N+1}^{(3)}\\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & \\vdots &  & \\vdots & \\vdots\\\\ 0 & 0 & a_{N3}^{(3)} & \\cdots & a_{NN}^{(3)} & a_{N,N+1}^{(3)}\\end{array}\\right].$$"}, {"category_type": "text_block", "poly": [255.0579, 1686.8868, 1361.0802, 1686.8868, 1361.0802, 1805.9419, 255.0579, 1805.9419], "ignore": false, "order": 8, "anno_id": "box_id_6", "attribute": {}, "text": "*Step$ p + 1 $ .*This is the general step. If necessary, switch row $p $ with some row beneath it so that $ {a}_{pp}^{\\left( p\\right) } \\neq 0 $ ; then eliminate $ {x}_{p} $ in rows$ p + 1 $ through $N $ . Here$ {m}_{rp} $ is the multiple of row $ p $ that is subtracted from row $ r $ ."}, {"category_type": "code_txt", "poly": [580.0377, 1826.0573, 846.0054, 1826.0573, 846.0054, 1968.9702, 580.0377, 1968.9702], "ignore": false, "order": 9, "anno_id": "box_id_7", "attribute": {}, "text": "\"for $r=p+1:N$\n\n${m}_{rp} = {a}_{rp}^{\\left( p\\right) }/{a}_{pp}^{\\left( p\\right) };$\n\n${a}_{rp}^{\\left( p+1\\right) }=0;$\""}, {"category_type": "page_number", "poly": [243.9828, 239.0458, 300.20892333984375, 239.0458, 300.20892333984375, 276.00200000000007, 243.9828, 276.00200000000007], "ignore": false, "order": 0, "anno_id": "box_id_8", "attribute": {}, "text": "130"}, {"category_type": "header", "poly": [323.3482666015625, 244.89120483398438, 1031.0260009765625, 244.89120483398438, 1031.0260009765625, 277.6719055175781, 323.3482666015625, 277.6719055175781], "ignore": false, "order": 1, "anno_id": "box-933lgh64", "attribute": {}, "text": "CHAP.3 THE SOLUTION OF LINEAR SYSTEMS$ A X = B$"}], "page_info": {"page_no": 0, "height": 2339, "width": 1653, "image_path": "page-bd6eb36e-0856-4d9d-b587-21b4a0209c8b.png", "page_attribute": {"data_source": "academic_literature", "language": "english", "layout": "single_column", "special_issue": [], "subset": "equation_hard"}}, "extra": {"relation": []}, "_eval_tags": {"is_clean": true, "has_watermark": false, "has_fuzzy_scan": false, "has_colorful_bg": false, "layout": "single_column"}}